OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer thought child would be
OL,4,Astabbed, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FCumbria Police firearms officer
OL,7,Fidentified in court as Officer C, told
OL,8,Fthe inquest he "absolutely" thought
OL,9,FKuzmenko was going to stab the child.
